WEBVTT

00:22:28.121 --> 00:22:31.246
I applied to this one school because
it was a small school.

00:22:31.246 --> 00:22:34.913
I was overwhelmed of thinking, like going
to like the University of Minnesota.

00:22:34.913 --> 00:22:38.246
It just seemed too big. So, yeah, you know
, I look back at it and think,

00:22:38.246 --> 00:22:40.538
what was I thinking? And all I can say is

00:22:40.538 --> 00:22:42.913
I just didn't have that
information available.

00:22:43.079 --> 00:22:45.329
And I think we think this is so unique.

00:22:45.954 --> 00:22:48.371
But it's not I mean, it's the reality for

00:22:48.371 --> 00:22:52.579
a lot of kids living in poverty that
they don't know the way to college.

00:22:53.746 --> 00:22:55.913
For your sophomore year,
you transferred to

00:22:55.913 --> 00:22:59.746
the University of Minnesota in Minneapolis
and you studied English

00:22:59.746 --> 00:23:03.788
and women's studies. What did you think
you wanted to do professionally at that